# Copy the per-app examples, not this file:
#   apps/api/.env.example    -> apps/api/.env
#   apps/web/.env.example    -> apps/web/.env
#   apps/mobile/.env.example -> apps/mobile/.env
#
# This file only lists which secrets live where.
#
# GitHub repo secrets (Settings -> Secrets and variables -> Actions):
#   CRON_SECRET            same value as apps/api CRON_SECRET
# GitHub repo variables:
#   API_BASE_URL           https://<your-api>.vercel.app
#
# Vercel (api project) env:  everything in apps/api/.env.example
# Vercel (web project) env:  everything in apps/web/.env.example
